Chosen original assembly: 200 x 200 x 10 SHS is projected behind the A-A front anchor-row section. Four M24 rods have 30 mm plate holes, 60 x 60 x 6 plate washers and 36 AF x 19 high nuts. Each 80 x 80 x 20 embedded anchor plate bears on a lower nut. Rod ends are 475 mm below concrete and 115 mm above it; chosen 130 mm top thread allows the shown stack. Cast-solid rods require accurate
